{ia16}{offset105}{arial}"I am {arialbld}Fujiro Goziya,{arial} Admiral of the Imperial Fleet, Supreme Commander of Fanato Forces.{pause}

My troops control the capital, {arialbld}Fanazaki,{arial} don't doubt my authority, this morning I imprisoned your puppet the emperor Tagamoshi, he will soon be judged by the Navy Tribunal for high treason.{offset0}{pause}





You, Schyzos and Normos, are worse invaders than the Paranos, as you have succeeded in contaminating the spirit of the emperor with ideas which endanger the Fanato Empire. The Nikonese traditions must be defended by a strong emperor, Tagamoshi being unworthy, I will be that emperor.{pause}

I am giving you {arialbld}24h{arial} to scatter from Nikonese soil, past this deadline you will be annihilated by my "Divine Winds" forces, my all-powerful army. Your operation Tsunami is by comparison a boy scout parade.{pause} 


{offset150}{arialbld}Fujiro Goziya the First{arial}

Fanato Emperor


{offset200}{signature2}{offset0}





{arialbld}GENERAL ALERT{arial}!{pause}

We have received this message less than an hour ago, it's not a hoax, we've obtained confirmation.

It seems that Admiral Goziya exceeded his authority by incarcerating the emperor. In my opinion it seems like a coup d'état.{pause}

I doubt however that Goziya can count on massive support from the population, although he's a national hero, he's a despotic ultratraditionalist who only gets worse with age, he instigated a reign of terror even in his own army. With him in power Nikondo would return 200 years into the past.{pause}

This does not leave us any choice other than to prepare an attack and liberate Fanazaki before Goziya's "justice" condemns the emperor.

A last minute trump card might save us from this turn of events. We have just received a very powerful new rocket defense system.{pause}











{center}{device41}











{pause}Your base is already equipped with two of these batteries, I hope they'll stand firm as long as possible.


{offset150}{arialbld}Tyron Spirex{arial}

Strategist of TSUNAMI



